## RULES
- If offer_id is absent, set it to null and add "offer_id" to missing_inputs
- Set confidence based on extraction clarity
- Do NOT call any tools — that is for the DiagnosticAgent
- Do NOT suggest solutions
- Produce exactly ONE JSON response, then STOP
